Story 4 is implemented. End-to-end coverage now calls the four MCP tools and `/health` through the FastAPI app, with GraphQL mocked.

**File changed:** `tests/test_integration.py`

- Tests 14–17 call each tool over the in-process SSE app and check the success payloads.
- Test 18 turns a GraphQL failure into `{"error": "..."}`, then confirms a later tool call and `/health` still succeed.
- Test 19 checks `/health` returns 200 and `{"status": "ok"}`.
- Test 20 checks an empty id returns `{"error": "Missing required parameter: id"}` and does not call GraphQL.

`pytest -q` is green (21 passed) and Ruff is clean on the new file.
